<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Jan palm oil exports 616,372t-Caleb Brett.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Jan palm oil exports 616,372t-Caleb Brett.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Caleb Brett put Malaysia's January bulk palm oil exports at 616,372 tonnes against its estimate of 702,082 for December, traders said.</p>
<p>The figures include laurics and oleochemicals but exclude shipments to Singapore and exports in drum, said the traders who obtained the data by facsimile.</p>
<p>The official Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority put December exports at 637,899 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
